# Verifies: SPEC §4 (variables and mutability) / DECISIONS D-COL-02 (subscript assignment on list/dict) / D-DIAG-02 E3001
# A subscript assignment `xs[i] = v` produces E3001 unless the target variable is a var
# binding (D-COL-02: "a type error (E3001) unless the target variable is var").

xs = [1, 2, 3]
xs[0] = 99
print(xs[0])
